      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKSIE ROCK (2) did a good job to come from wide on the back row and finish fourth last start at this circuit and distance. Likely to get the favours from this much better draw so has winning claims. VESPA STRIDE (8) has been racing at Menangle and producing some good efforts including a minor placing after racing three wide without cover two runs ago. Drawn on the back row but if he gets some racing room he is good enough to take out a race like this. RACING WRITER (9) strikes at 50 per cent at this circuit and distance and hasn't been too far from the placegetters at his last couple, coming from a similar draw to this when beaten only 2.8m two back at Newcastle. HESAA LISTER (3) draws well and is worth some thought off a placing from the second line here two back.",
